# InkdFrames

> Turn your Galaxy Ultra into a portable animation studio.

InkdFrames is a mobile-first frame-by-frame animation and rotoscoping application designed specifically around the Samsung S Pen.

## Vision

Most professional rotoscoping software requires:

- A desktop computer
- A graphics tablet
- Expensive software

InkdFrames removes those barriers by turning a Galaxy Ultra into a portable animation studio.

## MVP Features

- Import video
- Draw over individual frames
- Pressure-sensitive S Pen drawing
- Onion skinning
- Timeline scrubbing
- Playback
- Export animation

## Status

🚧 Early Development.